OL,3,GNEWSAFrom heroic big sister to diva
OL,4,Adog, awards recognise those making
OL,5,A'incredible difference'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen three-year-old Nel was diagnosed
OL,8,Fwith a rare chromosome disorder, her
OL,9,Fbig sister was determined to help.
OL,11,FMaisie, 11, started out wanting to buy
OL,12,Fsensory equipment for Nel, and her
OL,13,Ffundraising journey grew into a desire
OL,14,Fto help her whole community - from
OL,15,Forganising own clothes days in her
OL,16,Fschool to completing a Twin Peak
OL,17,Fchallenge.
OL,19,FCerys, Maisie's mum, said she was the
OL,20,F"best big sister to Nel".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
